  "wrapper_rule": "Every changed current native source increments source_revision exactly once; unchanged rows and original source bindings remain byte-exact. All key/storage/schema/version fields remain exact.",
  "origin_rule": "New source/value/result and actual original origin join same native commit; copied origins, after-the-fact origins and wrapper-hash/semantic-hash substitution fail.",
  "membership_rule": "Actual owner complete selection includes every exact run-associated schedule/window and consent; per-request arrays cannot omit or broaden. New concurrent original writes are excluded/revalidated by same owner fence.",
  "result_rule": "PlanEffect and ScheduleQuotaEffect link same authentic Goal cancellation, original scope, exact Stop and native transaction; both required even for authenticated empty scheduler set.",
  "terminal_rule": "No OwnerSettlement bound_plan_settled before genuine original effects; no none_required fallback on a bound execution.",
  "replay_rule": "Original result/source/receipt IDs and bytes unchanged; separate replay delivery carries replay_of; no second epoch or schedule revision increment.",
  "failure_rule": "Retain genuine C-stop and any separately genuine original effects. Never compensate by erasing original effects, minting a new run or treating missing custody as absence.",
  "callback_rule": "Original execution owner plus ToDoController plus native Scheduler independently validate current run/epoch/Stop/version/hash/work-binding/revisions at actual effects; receipt claim alone never fences callback.",
  "wrapper_anchor_rule": "Full StoragePlanRun includes null before genuine settlement and exact first completed/cancelled anchor thereafter; original SourceOrigin copies that anchor, non-run origin null. Logical PlanRun is unchanged.",
  "original_result_identity_rule": "Full StoragePlanCancelResult additionally retains exact original normalized C-source/request identity and original real operation reservations before Stop; record remains exact and replay_of null.",
  "retained_read_rule": "Selector-only retained route and complete compact custody/current native read boundaries; no original transient preparation or raw old value reacquisition. Success or unchanged NotSettled.",
  "retirement_rule": "Existing native Janitor/maintenance owner atomically writes compact original authority successor receipt and removes only exact eligible full Run row; protects all original origins/receipts, uses original first completion anchor and unchanged runtime policy, no EventRecord manifest authority.",
  "retirement_origin_rule": "The narrow retirement receipt carries its actual original native Storage owner/operation/transaction directly; no recursive origin-of-origin and no after-the-fact receipt mint."
}
